{"4738490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rebel Wraith", "steam_appid": 4738490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebel Wraith is a fast-paced action game where you can instantly switch between three different characters. Each character has their own abilities, weaknesses, and parkour mechanics. Switch between characters based on the flow of combat, create short strategies, and use your reflexes to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738490/extras/6eb6fd101f81fadc1f3e4ff545b82ce9.poster.avif?t=1788145952\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738490/extras/6eb6fd101f81fadc1f3e4ff545b82ce9.webm?t=1788145952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738490/extras/6eb6fd101f81fadc1f3e4ff545b82ce9.mp4?t=1788145952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the main goals of the game is to make every fight feel fast, smooth, and satisfying. Defeating enemies becomes a fun action loop that combines movement, timing, and ability usage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738490/extras/e457bdc7c1a3be8e45ba802d39ceceee.poster.avif?t=1788145952\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738490/extras/e457bdc7c1a3be8e45ba802d39ceceee.webm?t=1788145952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738490/extras/e457bdc7c1a3be8e45ba802d39ceceee.mp4?t=1788145952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With different ability sets, movement styles, outfits, and color themes, each character offers a unique gameplay feel. Rebel Wraith aims to bring together smooth movement, quick decision-making, and skill-based action to create an energetic and replayable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebel Wraith is a fast-paced action game where you can instantly switch between three different characters. Each character has their own abilities, weaknesses, and parkour mechanics. Switch between characters based on the flow of combat, create short strategies, and use your reflexes to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738490/extras/6eb6fd101f81fadc1f3e4ff545b82ce9.poster.avif?t=1788145952\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738490/extras/6eb6fd101f81fadc1f3e4ff545b82ce9.webm?t=1788145952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738490/extras/6eb6fd101f81fadc1f3e4ff545b82ce9.mp4?t=1788145952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the main goals of the game is to make every fight feel fast, smooth, and satisfying. Defeating enemies becomes a fun action loop that combines movement, timing, and ability usage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738490/extras/e457bdc7c1a3be8e45ba802d39ceceee.poster.avif?t=1788145952\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738490/extras/e457bdc7c1a3be8e45ba802d39ceceee.webm?t